  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBaseNonEdible">
    <defName>RM_LureVenomvine</defName>
    <label>lure venomvine</label>
    <description>Among the black canes hang fruit as pale and soft as a pearl, and sweet enough to smell from across a field. Every grazer for a mile knows the smell. The fruit is the bait; the thicket is the trap, and what follows the grazers is the rest of the story.</description>
